[standards/application/api/STD-APP-API-001-api-design.md#standard-response-structure]

#### Standard Response Structure

Use consistent response envelope format:

```json
{
    "data": {
        "id": "12345",
        "name": "John Doe",
        "email": "john@example.com"
    },
    "meta": {
        "timestamp": "2025-08-24T10:30:00Z",
        "version": "1.0"
    }
}
```

page_texts.17:
[standards/application/api/STD-APP-API-001-api-design.md#collection-response-format]

#### Collection Response Format

For collections, include pagination metadata:

```json
{
    "data": [
        { "id": "1", "name": "Item 1" },
        { "id": "2", "name": "Item 2" }
    ],
    "meta": {
        "pagination": {
            "page": 1,
            "limit": 20,
            "total": 150,
            "pages": 8
        }
    }
}
```

page_texts.22:
[standards/application/api/STD-APP-API-001-api-design.md#standard-error-response-format]

#### Standard Error Response Format

```json
{
    "error": {
        "code": "VALIDATION_ERROR",
        "message": "Validation failed for the request",
        "details": [
            {
                "field": "email",
                "message": "Invalid email format",
                "code": "INVALID_FORMAT"
            }
        ],
        "timestamp": "2025-08-24T10:30:00Z",
        "trace_id": "abc123def456"
    }
}
```

