[standards/application/api/STD-APP-API-001-api-design.md#example-2-error-response]

#### Example 2: Error Response

```http
# Invalid request
POST /api/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "email": "invalid-email"
}

# Response
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
{
  "error": {
    "code": "VALIDATION_ERROR",
    "message": "Request validation failed",
    "details": [
      {
        "field": "name",
        "message": "Name is required",
        "code": "REQUIRED_FIELD"
      },
      {
        "field": "email",
        "message": "Invalid email format",
        "code": "INVALID_FORMAT"
      }
    ]
  }
}
```

